      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "to Valhalla,",
      "translation" : "來到瓦爾哈拉，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the Hall of Honor.",
      "translation" : "榮譽之殿。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Valkyrie]",
      "translation" : "[女武神]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, you have not yet been invited here. I ask you to leave immediately. Honor to the warriors!",
      "translation" : "很遺憾，你還沒有受邀來到這裡。我請你立刻離開。願榮耀歸於勇士！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Metheus Sylphe",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Metheus Sylphe]",
      "translation" : "[梅修斯·希爾弗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Metheus Sylphe",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to the Library of the Schweicherbil Magic Academy.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到施威徹勒比爾魔法學院圖書館。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Metheus Sylphe",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I assume you have come here",
      "translation" : "我想你是來這裡"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Metheus Sylphe",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "to read the 'Book of Ymir.'",
      "translation" : "閱讀《尤彌爾之書》的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Metheus Sylphe",
